        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1313S  Dome Style Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis domed style upright floor stop is very easy to install. Packaged with a mounting anchor and rubber bumper ring.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDurable, modern, futuristic design, plus great protection for your door hardware and walls.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOnly 1 hole to drill for fast easy installation. The black rubber bumper ring goes all the way around the door stop, allowing you to install it just about anywhere on the floor for door contact. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions 1313S Modern Floor Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base to Bumper Center Height: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: Black</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
